NAME
       splinter - run a program under the speculative engine

SYNOPSIS
       splinter run <program> [args...]
       splinter spec

DESCRIPTION
       Runs a program under the speculative execution engine, which
       places work on a free core and keeps a shadow copy so a
       transaction can be committed or rolled back when a conflict is
       detected.

       This is research plumbing, not a general launcher.

SEE ALSO
       ps(1), sysmon(1)
